            <span class="ticket-badge">Featured build</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ticket-body">
            <h3>Specialized S-Works</h3>
            <div class="ticket-sub">SHOP FEATURE · FULL BUILD</div>
            <div class="ticket-perf"></div>
            <ul class="spec-list">
              <li><span>Groupset</span><span>Shimano Dura-Ace</span></li>
              <li><span>Wheels</span><span>Roval, carbon</span></li>
              <li><span>Tires</span><span>Cotton-wall tubs</span></li>
              <li><span>Cockpit</span><span>Roval one-piece bar/stem</span></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="ticket-cta">
              <a class="btn btn-ghost" style="width:100%; justify-content:center;" href="https://wa.me/201157343199" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask about this build</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="categories">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Not sure where to start</span>
          <h2>Shop by category</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Three racks, three riding styles. Tell us which one and we'll point you to what's in stock.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="category-grid">
        <a class="category-card" href="https://wa.me/201157343199?text=Looking%20for%20a%20road%20bike" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg class="category-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <circle cx="16" cy="46" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <circle cx="48" cy="46" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
