          </svg>
          <h3>Mountain bikes</h3>
          <p>Flat bars, knobby tread, ready for trail and dirt.</p>
          <span class="category-link">Ask what's in stock →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="category-card" href="https://wa.me/201157343199?text=Looking%20for%20a%20kids%20bike" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg class="category-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
